    9 00000000         ;* Description        : STM32F103xB Devices vector table
                        for MDK-ARM toolchain. 
   10 00000000         ;*                      This module performs:
   11 00000000         ;*                      - Set the initial SP
   12 00000000         ;*                      - Set the initial PC == Reset_Ha
                       ndler
   13 00000000         ;*                      - Set the vector table entries w
                       ith the exceptions ISR address
   14 00000000         ;*                      - Configure the clock system
   15 00000000         ;*                      - Branches to __main in the C li
                       brary (which eventually
   16 00000000         ;*                        calls main()).
   17 00000000         ;*                      After Reset the Cortex-M3 proces
                       sor is in Thread mode,
   18 00000000         ;*                      priority is Privileged, and the 
                       Stack is set to Main.
